{"code":0,"data":{"title":"构建收银台下单参数","content":"<h1 id=\"s-0dv40ayp\">一、接口说明</h1><p>该接口仅用于开发者服务端对接支付时生成固定格式参数，快应用服务端使用该接口不做http请求。开发者服务端将生成的参数返回给业务自己的前端/客户端即可，端上调用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/813\">快应用引擎拉起收银台方法</a>后，由快应用引擎使用该参数进行真实网络请求下单。</p><h1 id=\"s-3dsaqwf1\"><br>二、构建所需参数</h1><h2 id=\"s-ouapr42s\">2.1 公共参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>version</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1.0.0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】接口版本号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivopay.wallet.trade.create</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】使用的接口服务名称，固定值</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>2019002536451112</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】应用编号，创建应用时分配</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20180724030750</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】发送请求的时间，格式：yyyyMMddHHmmss</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ALKHIKYQUIHLBNLAHKLHLHJL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】签名，用于验签，签名字段获取见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>signType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>RSA</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】签名方式，固定RSA</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizContent</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Json</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"94\" style=\"width: 94px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"357\" style=\"width: 357px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>{\"merchantOrderNo\":\"20190316154879313465\"}</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】请求参数的集合，最大长度不限，下文 2.2、bizContent业务参数所有请求参数都必须放在这个参数中传递；<br>格式：业务参数拼接成的Json对象字符串。建议通过vivo pay sdk传参。传参参数为 VivopayWalletTradeCreateRequest，Model对象为 VivopayWalletTradeCreateModel</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-sn3svgbr\">2.2 bizContent 业务参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易类型，即商户与支付签约的产品码，快应用固定为 QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>2133935087946062193</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商户订单号，开发者自己的订单号，需保证订单号在该应用下唯一 (订单长度不能大于64个字符)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityDesc</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>漫画</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品描述（用于收银台展示,长度不能大于512个字符,不能为空或空字符）</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品类型，0=虚拟类，1=实体类</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityDetails</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>[{\"commodityCount\":\"1\",\"commodityId\":<br>\"120464\",\"commodityPrice\":\"299900\",<br>\"commodityName\":\"iQOO Neo5 12GB+256GB 云影蓝\"}]</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品信息列表，json数组，见2.2.1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>400</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>currencyType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>CNY</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>货币类型</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>expiredTime</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20190525121212</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单过期时间，格式：yyyyMMddHHmmss, 订单超过过期时间将无法支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>extInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>拓展参数&nbsp;回调通知会原样返回</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>notifyUrl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://openfinancedeprecated.site.vmic.xyz/developer/QUICK_APP_API/vivopay_wallet_trade_create/#%E4%BA%8C-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%89%80%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0\">http://xxx.xx.com/callback</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付完成回调通知URL</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>callBackVersion</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"405\" style=\"width: 405px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>UNIFY</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"479\" style=\"width: 479px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>回调版本标识，固定UNIFY</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-ll95h9co\">2.2.1 commodityDetails 中的商品对象信息</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"557\" style=\"width: 557px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"557\" style=\"width: 557px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品id，仅作信息留存，如若没有开发者可自行传String格式数据即可</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"557\" style=\"width: 557px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品名称 ,仅作信息留存(字段最大长度不能超过256个字符,不能为空或空字符)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityPrice</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"557\" style=\"width: 557px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品单价，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"155\" style=\"width: 155px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityCount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"95\" style=\"width: 95px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"557\" style=\"width: 557px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>购买数量</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-yya5dafu\"><br>三、构建示例</h1><h2 id=\"s-3c490b49\">3.1 请求参数示例</h2><p><code>sign</code> 签名字段获取见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p><pre><code>{\n        \"method\": \"vivopay.wallet.trade.create\",\n        \"appId\": \"10042134334\",\n        \"bizContent\": \"{\\\"commodityDesc\\\":\\\"iQOO Neo5 12GB+256GB 云影蓝\\\",\\\"commodityType\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"currencyType\\\":\\\"CNY\\\",\\\"expiredTime\\\":\\\"20240911214044\\\",\\\"merchantOrderNo\\\":\\\"201903164321798794611543414\\\",\\\"notifyUrl\\\":\\\"http://xxx.xx.com/callback\\\",\\\"tradeType\\\":\\\"QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER\\\"}\",\n        \"sign\": \"aRgZAoFkrIMKZIAHJA5mSdfpXJljmt2FaGqvxcuVxDsGMGjcaWQwVCNK/z1IeczR5WnxOpSocn2jekwW9CBn3ZqxmfyuqwDP4yDbUNU7+/Rk+KsPWaKfsT+c2BAr/dIeWvYLQICnDnYum71o333hC0a06scktyZY=\",\n        \"signType\": \"RSA\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"20240911194044\"\n    }\n</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-396toyax\">3.2 Java语言sdk构建示例</h2><pre><code>public class VivopayWalletTradeCreateDemo {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws VivopayApiException {\n        VivoClient vivoClient = new DefaultVivoClient(\"RSA\", 应用私钥);\n        VivopayWalletTradeCreateRequest request = new VivopayWalletTradeCreateRequest();\n        request.setAppId(appid);\n        request.setTimestamp(new Date());\n        request.setBizModel(getBizModel());\n        // 快应用接入调用 sdkExecute 仅作构建参数请求\n        VivopayWalletTradeCreateResponse response = vivoClient.sdkExecute(request);\n        System.out.println(\"构建参数结果:\" + JSON.toJSONString(response));\n    }\n    public static VivopayWalletTradeCreateModel getBizModel(){\n        VivopayWalletTradeCreateModel bizModel = new VivopayWalletTradeCreateModel();\n        bizModel.setMerchantOrderNo(\"MOBILECASHIER_SHOP\");\n        bizModel.setxxxxx();\n        ......\n        return bizModel;\n    }\n}\n</code></pre><p><br></p>","versionCode":7,"updateTime":1729760669000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用支付平台接入,收银台模式,构建收银台下单参数","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}